<title>BELGIUM: EU clears CEGELEC buy of AEG unit -  source.</title>
<headline>EU clears CEGELEC buy of AEG unit -  source.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission has cleared the acquisition by CEGELEC S.A., belonging to Alcatel Alsthom, of AEG AAT, a European Union source said on Friday.</p>
<p>AEG AAT belongs to Germany's AEG, which is majority owned by Daimler-Benz.</p>
<p>-- Brussels newsroom +32 2 287 68 11</p>
</text>
